ListDirectives --> DirectiveRepository
UpdateDirective --> DirectiveRepository
LifecycleTransitions --> DirectiveRepository
LifecycleTransitions ..> LineageService

CompileDirectives --> CompilerReadPort
CompileDirectives --> CompiledRulesRepository
CompileDirectives ..> ResolveConflict
PublishCompiledRules --> CompiledRulesRepository
DrainOutbox --> CompileDirectives
ValidateDirectiveDocuments ..> Directive

CreateInspection --> TargetSourcesGateway
CreateInspection --> CompiledRulesRepository
CreateInspection --> InspectionArtifactPort
CreateInspection --> RunInspectionPipeline
GetInspection --> InspectionArtifactPort
RunInspectionPipeline --> CompiledRulesRepository
RunInspectionPipeline --> InspectionArtifactPort
RunInspectionPipeline --> FindingOpenPort
RunInspectionPipeline ..> ResolveConflict

GetFinding --> FindingEventRepository
ListFindings --> FindingEventRepository
TransitionFinding --> FindingEventRepository
TransitionFinding ..> FindingFsm
TransitionFinding --> CompiledRulesRepository
GetFindingGuidance --> FindingEventRepository
GetFindingGuidance --> GuidanceReadPort
AttachEvidence --> FindingEventRepository
AttachEvidence --> FindingArtifactPort
OpenFindings ..|> FindingOpenPort
OpenFindings --> FindingEventRepository
OpenFindings ..> FindingFsm
ListFindingAggregates --> FindingEventRepository
ReviewConflictArtifact --> FindingArtifactPort
ReviewConflictArtifact --> FindingEventRepository

CreateDirective ..> DirectiveCreateRequest
UpdateDirective ..> DirectiveUpdateRequest
CreateInspection ..> InspectRequest
CreateInspection ..> InspectResponse
TransitionFinding ..> FindingTransitionRequest
ListFindingAggregates ..> AggregateQueryRequest
OpenFindings ..> DetectionOutcome

